  "project_description": "Field to store multiple attributes and values per entity. Field implements EAV (Entity–attribute–value) data model.\n\n Supported value types:\n\n- string\n\n- string_long\n\n- integer\n\n- decimal\n\n- boolean\n\n- entity_reference\n\n- list_string\n\n- list_integer\n\n Search API module is supported in a contrib module Search API EAV Field .\n\n Installation: \n\nRead README.txt \n\n Alternatives: \n\n* Properties Field \n\n* Matrix fields",
